37	/// (`ResponseOutputItem`, `openai/types/responses/response_output_item.py`) has a `status` field.
38	/// For these an absent `status` at `done` is a truncation (R15, ruling T4b). The models of
39	/// `custom_tool_call`, `mcp_approval_request` and `mcp_approval_response` have no `status` field,
40	/// and a type that the union does not have has no model. `custom_tool_call_output` is
41	/// `ResponseCustomToolCallOutputItem` in the union, which declares `status`; the input model
42	/// `ResponseCustomToolCallOutput` does not.
